[3.945, "o", "\u001b[1m# ACH: test_checkout_total fails ~1 in 8 CI runs (SYNTHETIC EXAMPLE)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.015, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.085, "o", "**Question:** What makes test_checkout_total fail intermittently in CI?\r\n"]
[4.155, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.225, "o", "\u001b[1m## Conclusion\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.295, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.365, "o", "- Tie: several hypotheses share the lowest inconsistency score.\r\n"]
[4.435, "o", "- Leader(s): H1, H5 (margin over the next: 21)\r\n"]
[4.505, "o", "- This is a ranking of inconsistencies, **not a probability**.\r\n"]
[4.575, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.645, "o", "\u001b[1m## Hypothesis ranking (lower inconsistency = better)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.715, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.785, "o", "| # | Hypothesis | Inconsistency | State | Contradicted by |\r\n"]
[4.855, "o", "|---|-----------|---------------:|--------|-----------------|\r\n"]
[4.925, "o", "| 1 | **H1** Race condition between xdist workers on a session-scoped fixture | 0 | alive | — |\r\n"]
[4.995, "o", "| 1 | **H5** Leftover DB state from another test that ran earlier on the same worker | 0 | alive | — |\r\n"]
[5.065, "o", "| 1 | **H6** Something else I am not considering | 0 | catch-all | — |\r\n"]
[5.135, "o", "| 2 | **H2** Clock/timezone dependence (datetime.now near a day boundary) | 21 | refuted | E2, E1 |\r\n"]
[5.205, "o", "| 3 | **H3** Real, unmocked network call that sometimes answers slowly or errors | 27 | refuted | E4, E1 |\r\n"]
[5.275, "o", "| 4 | **H4** Non-deterministic set/dict ordering (PYTHONHASHSEED) changes a float sum | 33 | refuted | E3, E1, E5 |\r\n"]
[5.345, "o", "\r\n"]
